WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.800
Publicly released models enter the ecosystem.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.750
Model laundering can hide their origins.

00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:08.700
Whose model is this suspect?

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:14.650
AttnDiff probes semantic conflicts, measures attention changes,
and extracts spectral fingerprints.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.800
Fingerprint similarity reveals evidence of model lineage.
